set : 집합=> 중복x, 순서x

```
s1 = set([1,2,3])
s1
>>>{1,2,3}
s2 = set('hello')
s2
>> {'h','e','l','o'}
```
### 교집합
```
s1 = set([1,2,3,4])
s2 = set([3,4,5,6])
s1 & s2
>>>{3,4}
s1.intersectoin(s2)
```
### 합집합
```
s1 | s2
s1.union(s2)
>>>{1,2,3,4,5,6}
```
### 차집합
```
s1-s2
s1.difference(s2)
>>>{1,2}
```
### 추가
```
s1.add(6)
# 여러개 추가
s1.update([7,8,9])
```
### 삭제
```
s1.remove(1)
```
